This repository is public for one purpose only: deploying the website via
GitHub Pages. It is NOT open source, and its presence on GitHub grants no
licence to anyone.

All platform content — the interactive questions and their texts, the
illustrations, images and book cards, the audio recordings, the visual
design and the "Shoogp" identity, and the source code — is owned by the
platform owner and protected by copyright and related-rights law (Sultanate
of Oman Royal Decree 65/2008 as amended, and international treaties).

Without the owner's prior written permission you may NOT:
  • copy the questions, artwork, audio or any part of the content;
  • republish, host, mirror or embed the platform in another site or app;
  • modify, translate or create derivative works from the content;
  • use it commercially or to train artificial-intelligence models.

You MAY only:
  • browse the published site and use it for classroom teaching;
  • read the code on GitHub for reference, without copying or reusing it.

The school curricula on which the questions are based belong to the
Ministry of Education of the Sultanate of Oman; the questions here are
original work inspired by them and do not reproduce textbook text.

Enquiries and permission requests: via the contact channels on the site.
